 "text": " Hello, this is Maya from Cynia Scheduling. How can I help you today? Good morning, Maya speaking. What appointment would you like to book? I can help you schedule a booking. What date works best for you? Let me check availability. One moment, please. Yes, we have slots available on Tuesday at 10 in the morning. Would you prefer morning or afternoon? I can book you for Thursday at 2 in the afternoon. Does that work? Let me repeat that. Tuesday, March 15th, 10 in the morning, correct? Your appointment is confirmed. You'll get an SMS reminder. Would you like to reschedule? I can help with that. I'm sorry, that time is fully booked. How about 1130? The doctor is available on Friday, morning or afternoon. Your booking reference is C-Y-N472. Note that down. A reminder will be sent one day before your appointment. Is there anything else I can help you schedule? I understand. Let me find an earlier slot for you. Sawa sawa. Your booking is all set. Thank you for choosing Cynia. Have a wonderful day. Goodbye, and see you on Tuesday.",
